    <guid isPermaLink="false">67f3d8e40decaeb0947f2dfd</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 08 Apr 2025 01:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>潮汕人的胃是512G顶配版！牛肉火锅只是新手村任务，暗巷里的美食buff才炸裂：藏在街角蒸腾的粿条屉里，生腌虾鲜到打激灵，砂锅粥咕嘟着海鲜暴击！温馨提示：建议携带256G胃扩容包，没炫够..........这十样，系统不承认你通关潮汕副本！（馋哭警告😋）</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎本期嘉宾：潮汕美食野生代言人——猪猪🥳</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Show Notes:</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="55">00:55</a> 新手误区提示！潮汕美食主线任务已更新</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="168">02:48</a> 粿条汤VS粿汁，猪猪现场“报菜名”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="260">04:20</a> BOSS战掉落：S级弹性食材的牛肉丸/牛筋丸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a> 粿粿变形记：从祭祀供品到街头烟火</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="530">08:50</a> 甜蜜陷阱关卡：反沙双连击（芋头/番薯）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="580">09:40</a> 海鲜副本加载：生腌暴击率+200%</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="694">11:34</a> 砂锅粥：虾蟹/鳝鱼/鸽子 鲜味buff叠满</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="825">13:45</a> 珍藏放送！甘草水果/腐乳鸡翅/猪脚圈/菜头丸......</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌟开启支线任务【收集所有粿粿皮肤】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjiSPydX01d-k7-ktXPcYb_8VY5G.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>BGM：</span></strong><span>西湖水</span></p>]]></description>
