  <item>
    <title>救命！怎么没人告诉我当伴娘也要渡劫</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/674d4d050ed328720adcc912</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">674d4d050ed328720adcc912</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 02 Dec 2024 06:07:40 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>每至年末，感觉都是一个结婚的旺季，充当伴娘或伴郎的“使命”似乎也难以推脱。</span></p><span></span><p><span>就拿 11 月来说，我的朋友圈就有好几个，包括我们自己也去当了两次伴娘。</span></p><span></span><p><span>所以这期想跟大家聊一聊，当伴娘的一些经历跟感触~</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Show Notes:</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="63">01:03</a> &nbsp;第一次当伴娘是一种什么感觉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="179">02:59</a> 人生经历＋1 雪地推车</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="428">07:08</a> 阿油第二次当伴娘经历|“土匪进村”“排着队拿着爱的号码牌”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="585">09:45</a> 小烨第二次当伴娘经历|“不文明接亲”“30+伴郎团”“彩带喷雾喷头”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="852">14:12</a> 找婚鞋环节 “会不会藏在你们伴娘身上啊” 令人窒息</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1042">17:22</a> 离谱婚闹事件 “婚闹不是性骚扰的遮羞布”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1364">22:44</a> 被闹伴娘时女生该怎么保护自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1421">23:41</a> 那些无法理解的习俗！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1532">25:32</a> 当伴娘超过三次会被分走姻缘？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1621">27:01</a> 结婚要送新娘什么礼物|百喜图、定制娃娃、数字油画、红酒杯、喜庆餐具、寓意好的植物</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1760">29:20</a> 随礼多少合适💰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1865">31:05</a> 有为对方的幸福落泪吗💞</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>BGM：</span></strong><span>Dream love</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lqOgypU1E6UAoCNRecYR9AyRx3X-.m4a" length="32629095" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:33:37</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrpwvIEPccuoAxQT98HTbd64xuHe.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>遇到这样的领导肯定是我姥爷拜得不到位！牛马报道</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6739b9c7f373fe5d4defb02a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6739b9c7f373fe5d4defb02a</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 18 Nov 2024 01:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>迎来了目前时长最长的一期</span></p><span></span><p><span>对于职场有太多能吐槽的事情跟各种奇葩的人</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎各位在评论区说出你的故事~</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝每个人在职场能遇到好的领导，薪想事成！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Show Notes:</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="40">00:40</a> 各自的工作经历职位|文案、医药代表、服装、游戏行业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="246">04:06</a> 听过外包公司吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="321">05:21</a> 有没有遇到过很好的领导/贵人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="596">09:56</a> 外派/驻场是什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a> 在某某跳动|某易大厂工作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="890">14:50</a> 那些很差劲的领导/同事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1032">17:12</a> 同事举报我 但老板跟我讲了🌝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1205">20:05</a> 姥爷拜得不到位 遇到SB主美！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1395">23:15</a> 又抠又双标(-᷅_-᷄)被我遇到了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1804">30:04</a> 职场上很作的同事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1882">31:22</a> 五天只上两天班的离谱同事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2034">33:54</a> 吃过的饼 背过的刺</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2300">38:20</a> 职场尴尬社死瞬间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2502">41:42</a> 拒绝职场内耗 渣男心态学起来！</span></p><span></span><p><span>“千万不要在职场做纯爱战士”&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>“人和人之间是需要共情的，但是共情不能跨越物种，我觉得打工人和老板 不是同一个物种”</span></p><span></span><p><span>“需求讲不清、生气只会乱吠”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2697">44:57</a> 离职请喝奶茶|离职红包是什么习俗？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>BGM：</span></strong><span>凑热闹</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ltcDsOLKQxmZX-cpYKsGqPFSDayh.m4a" length="47022230" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:48:27</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrpwvIEPccuoAxQT98HTbd64xuHe.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>感谢你在我青春里的友情赞助</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/671cc302eb46cd6655e09eef</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">671cc302eb46cd6655e09eef</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 26 Oct 2024 10:22:58 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>《绿皮书》里有这样一段话:"这世界上有各种各样的人，恰巧我们成为了朋友，这不是缘分，是因为我们本就应该是朋友”</span></p><p><span>我一直都很庆幸认识身边的那些好友，在朋友这件事上我从来不羡慕任何人，因为我的朋友足够棒，讲真的，你们在我身边我玩闹都有安全感。</span></p><p><span>好的友谊一定是轻松的，可以无顾忌地分享快乐，也不避讳展露痛楚，彼此尊重，以及发自内心的相互欣赏，遇到这样的朋友真的超级幸运。</span></p><p><span>各有各的朋友，很庆幸能够成为你的朋友，没什么好炫耀的，世中逢尔，你胜过千万泛泛之交。</span></p><p><strong><span>Show Notes:</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="50">00:50</a> </span></strong><span>谢谢你，我的阶段性朋友</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="240">04:00</a> </span></strong><span>结婚没叫你 OKFine👋</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="383">06:23</a> </span></strong><span>大学友情一毕业就没了</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="485">08:05</a> </span></strong><span>职场上只有同事和领导🙏</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="710">11:50</a> </span></strong><span>一段长久的友谊是怎样的状态 </span><strong><span>| </span></strong><span>20年+</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="982">16:22</a></span></strong><span> 朋友是给彼此充电的能量</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1107">18:27</a></span></strong><span> 时间在帮你筛选更值得的人</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1420">23:40</a></span></strong><span> 女性友谊的三次告别是：恋爱、结婚、生孩子吗？</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1643">27:23</a></span></strong><span> 职场朋友吃饭算加班吧！</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1767">29:27</a></span></strong><span> 朋友总是无意识的在拯救你</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1800">30:00</a></span></strong><span> 我把你当闺蜜 你说我只是朋友</span></p><p><strong><span>BGM：</span></strong><span>Silence-BeforeYouExit</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lnO2PBKMoSpP_Fy50pcb-ymBk1n4.m4a" length="30664087" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:31:35</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrpwvIEPccuoAxQT98HTbd64xuHe.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>有个能提供情绪价值的朋友or不会提供情绪价值</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66fe704d81cdab3a939ec7b3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66fe704d81cdab3a939ec7b3</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 03 Oct 2024 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>到底什么是情绪价值，并不是一味的支持肯定，而是需要真正的帮朋友去思考、解决问题</span></p><span></span><p><span>给大家点小建议：可以先耐心倾听、换位思考、在发言</span></p><span></span><p><span>也祝大家国庆节快乐~玩得开心！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Show Notes:</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="39">00:39</a> 怎么理解情绪价值这个词</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="92">01:32</a> 能提供情绪价值的朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="375">06:15</a> 中餐厅虞sx情绪价值拉满</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="607">10:07</a> 花少秦l反精神内耗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="775">12:55</a> 拍照出片必听</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="852">14:12</a> 不会提供情绪价值的朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1307">21:47</a> 给自己提供情绪价值也很重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1368">22:48</a> 杨l：非常擅长提供情绪价值那情绪就没有价值</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1572">26:12</a> 李d：提供情绪价值的本质是取悦自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1668">27:48</a> 脱口秀的魅力</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>BGM：</span></strong><span>누구세요(请问是谁)、fill me in love&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span><br><span></span><br><span></span><br><span></span><br><span></span><br><span></span><br><span></span></p>]]></description>
