  <item>
    <title>中秋节：属于潮汕人的浪漫</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66e9aadc5ca6d0ace38a32d0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66e9aadc5ca6d0ace38a32d0</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 18 Sep 2024 01:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>祝大家中秋节快乐~阖家安康！</span></p><span></span><p><span>大家今天都吃月饼了吗~来聊一聊中秋节属于潮汕特有的浪漫！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>潮汕“拜月娘”</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>“拜月娘”是广东潮汕各地有中秋拜月的习俗。在每年的农历八月十五晚上，潮汕人相信月娘能保佑人们平安顺遂、心想事成。不少潮汕小孩还会把他们的各种文具和园书本摆上供桌，祈盼月娘保佑他们聪明伶俐，读书进步，正是这一代又一代“拜月娘”文化的传承。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiGCrbiuVWzXzC63JOIhMrEf5gcg.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>潮汕“烧瓦塔”</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>“烧瓦塔”瓦塔由残砖瓦片砌成，高两三米，塔内填充柴草。烧瓦塔寓意着生活红红火火，也有纪念历史和驱虫的意义。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>瓦塔形状多样，有圆形塔、方形塔、多角形塔等，且各有其吉祥寓意，圆形塔寓意为“中秋月圆人也圆”，方形塔寓意四通八达，多角形塔寓意生财多道，生意兴隆。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnAK8OfNQscZJqYfdEEBEqMkECtq.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>潮汕地区还有其它独特的传统文化，期待你来亲身感受这份热闹与文化氛围！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Show Notes:</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="32">00:32</a>潮汕“拜月娘”</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="135">02:15</a>为什么都不爱吃月饼了呢</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="243">04:03</a>买过月饼吗</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="304">05:04</a>“黑悟空”联名月饼礼盒</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">06:00</a>哪儿有好吃的月饼嘞？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="430">07:10</a>除了月饼还有啥吃的</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="530">08:50</a>潮汕“烧瓦塔”</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="630">10:30</a>打工人怎么度过</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="788">13:08</a>长达10年+的友谊</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="840">14:00</a>广州游玩好去处</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>BGM：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>潮汕滴滴滴</span></p>]]></description>
